<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - America Online.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - America Online.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said it reiterated a strong buy rating on America Online Inc.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- America Online gained 2-7/8 to 73-1/2.</p>
</text>
